DESCRIPTION:Monte Loco Rides Again… Melbourne Ska Orchestra are coming to
  Hotel Brunswick Friday 18th September. Don’t miss out! Hot off the heel
 s of a wild year touring Canada and Australia in 2025\, Melbourne Ska Orch
 estra just can’t keep still. The spaghetti western wagon trail rolls on 
 with the super deluxe edition of their acclaimed album The Ballad of Monte
  Loco with all the faves\, plus a swag of brand-new tracks\, blistering li
 ve recordings\, and honky tonk renditions of MSO staples. It’s braver\, 
 meaner and wilder than anything they’ve done before. So saddle up\, part
 ner: this here posse is riding into a town near you\, and you do not want 
 to miss the showdown. Playing Hotel Brunswick Friday 18th September | Door
 s 6PM
